IMAPAccount mulatta
Host mail.mulatta.io
PassCmd "rbw get 'mulatta.io'"
Port 993
TLSType IMAPS
User seungwon

IMAPStore mulatta-remote
Account mulatta

MaildirStore mulatta-local
Inbox ~/.local/share/mail/mulatta/Inbox
Path ~/.local/share/mail/mulatta/
SubFolders Verbatim

Channel mulatta
Create Both
Expunge Both
Far :mulatta-remote:
Near :mulatta-local:
Patterns * "!Shared" "!Shared/*" "!sent"
Remove None
Sync All
SyncState *

